01:11:11.455 --> 01:11:15.403
or the scalability, cost
per participant was 435.

01:11:16.270 --> 01:11:18.910
The nearest program for the (indistinct).

01:11:18.910 --> 01:11:23.910
they were running a
program called Me Familia.

01:11:26.050 --> 01:11:28.990
They were starting to design
it before the pandemic.

01:11:28.990 --> 01:11:31.321
The program for participant was $600.

01:11:31.321 --> 01:11:33.197
- [Enquirer] This is per year?

01:11:33.197 --> 01:11:34.897
- [Moya] Per participant per year.

01:11:36.360 --> 01:11:41.020
And then the near CBT,
just not comparable,

01:11:41.020 --> 01:11:43.960
but the near CBT program is $6,000, right?

01:11:43.960 --> 01:11:48.853
So we can do this and
we can do this properly.

01:11:52.270 --> 01:11:54.187
I think a reasonable cost, right?

01:11:54.187 --> 01:11:55.540
And so right now we're working

01:11:55.540 --> 01:11:57.330
on what we call at-scale pilot,

01:11:57.330 --> 01:12:00.920
we're handing in the operation
to an external partner,

01:12:00.920 --> 01:12:01.990
actually Cardinal Alliance,

01:12:01.990 --> 01:12:05.450
which was, if you remember
the organization in Tumaco

01:12:05.450 --> 01:12:08.960
that provided some
mental health turnovers,

01:12:08.960 --> 01:12:10.960
we're moving towards five municipalities

01:12:12.107 --> 01:12:15.760
in the Caribbean Coast
and the Pacific region,

01:12:15.760 --> 01:12:18.322
different populations
in the Caribbean Coast

01:12:18.322 --> 01:12:23.090
(indistinct) which have high
influx of Venezuelan refugees.

01:12:23.090 --> 01:12:27.220
So we're already starting to
adapt the implementation there.

01:12:27.220 --> 01:12:30.930
And there's an ongoing
conversation to enhance the model

01:12:30.930 --> 01:12:32.380
with some play-based activities.

01:12:32.380 --> 01:12:34.080
And again, I mentioned at the beginning,

01:12:34.080 --> 01:12:38.190
we're trying to address
the different restriction,

01:12:38.190 --> 01:12:40.230
but of course this doesn't
mean that the restrictions

01:12:40.230 --> 01:12:43.360
that other programs are trying
to address are not there.

01:12:43.360 --> 01:12:45.890
So how can we compliment these strategies?

01:12:45.890 --> 01:12:49.480
And we're working with Sesame
Workshop to try to compliment,

01:12:49.480 --> 01:12:52.067
maybe have some activities
for the children

01:12:52.067 --> 01:12:55.130
and for this part we're gonna be using

01:12:55.130 --> 01:12:57.780
an implementation science
evaluation framework.

01:12:57.780 --> 01:12:59.980
So mostly focusing on the processes

01:12:59.980 --> 01:13:01.880
and not on the impacts.

01:13:01.880 --> 01:13:04.100
We're gonna do a pre-post follow up

01:13:04.100 --> 01:13:07.560
but not a proper impact in an issue.

01:13:07.560 --> 01:13:08.660
And I think that's it.

01:13:10.950 --> 01:13:14.900
