01:15:42.020 --> 01:15:46.430
in terms of differences
and exposure to violence

01:15:46.430 --> 01:15:49.490
or trauma among displaced
and non displaced persons.

01:15:49.490 --> 01:15:51.220
These are general communities,

01:15:51.220 --> 01:15:53.440
some of them have been displaced

01:15:53.440 --> 01:15:57.410
