from different neighborhoods,

01:15:57.410 --> 01:15:59.660
as different R groups
get to a neighborhood,

01:15:59.660 --> 01:16:01.530
the community has to move away.

01:16:01.530 --> 01:16:04.270
They're pretty much
integrated in the communities.

01:16:04.270 --> 01:16:08.090
We don't have displaced camps in Columbia.

01:16:08.090 --> 01:16:09.010
The displaced arrive

01:16:09.010 --> 01:16:10.740
and they're pretty much the same, culture,

01:16:10.740 --> 01:16:12.070
everything is the same.

01:16:12.070 --> 01:16:15.150
And they settle in
outskirts of the cities,

01:16:15.150 --> 01:16:16.730
in Tumaco it's pretty much
the same neighborhood.

01:16:16.730 --> 01:16:20.450
So at least when you talk to people,

01:16:20.450 --> 01:16:23.450
